WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.527
Week 21: Direct and Indirect Objects. track who receives what avoid unnecessary repetition clarify a transaction

2
00:00:08.527 --> 00:00:22.135
Operational objective. By the end of this section you can track who receives what, avoid unnecessary repetition, clarify a transaction. The focus is useful performance, not isolated terminology.

3
00:00:22.135 --> 00:00:30.790
Language system. Direct- and indirect-object pronouns; placement with conjugated verbs, infinitives, gerunds, and commands.

4
00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:37.739
Sound and delivery. Attach pronouns as one rhythmic unit while preserving written accent placement.

5
00:00:37.739 --> 00:00:47.165
Core principle. Notice meaning first, then form. Retrieve the new language aloud, compare it with the model, and repair one feature at a time.

6
00:00:47.165 --> 00:01:12.783
Model language. Le envié el mensaje esta mañana. — I sent him or her the message this morning. El paquete lo recibió otra persona. — Someone else received the package. ¿Puedes mostrármelo? — Can you show it to me? No les expliqué el cambio. — I did not explain the change to them. Devuélvale los documentos al gerente. — Return the documents to the manager.

7
00:01:12.783 --> 00:01:22.702
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
